<block wx:if="{{deferred}}"><view class="page">支付功能已预留，待接入方案确定后再启用。</view></block><block wx:else><view class="page"><view class="title">支付中心 · 会员钱包更正</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{wallet}}"><view>钱包编号：{{wallet.id}}</view><view>用户编号：{{wallet.userId}}</view><view>可用余额：{{wallet.balanceText}} 元</view><view>累计充值：{{wallet.rechargeText}} 元</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{receipt}}"><view>{{receipt.state === 'APPLIED' ? '已入账回执' : '取消回执'}}</view><view>回执编号：{{receipt.id}}</view><view wx:if="{{receipt.transactionId}}">流水编号：{{receipt.transactionId}}</view><view>变动：{{receipt.amount}} 元</view><block wx:if="{{receipt.state === 'APPLIED'}}"><view>入账前：{{receipt.before}} 元</view><view>入账后：{{receipt.after}} 元</view><view>累计充值：{{receipt.totalAfter}} 元</view></block><view>原因：{{receipt.reason}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><view>有一笔尚未核对的请求，填写新更正前请先处理。</view><view>原因：{{pending.reason}}</view><button bindtap="check" disabled="{{busy}}">查询回执</button><button bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy || !enabled}}">重新提交原请求</button><button bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy || !enabled}}">取消原请求并核对</button></view><view wx:elif="{{enabled && wallet}}"><view>沿用原平台口径：余额及累计充值同时增减。</view><radio-group bindchange="direction"><label><radio value="increase" checked="{{direction === 'increase'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>增加</label><label><radio value="decrease" checked="{{direction === 'decrease'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>减少</label></radio-group><input type="digit" placeholder="变动金额（元）" value="{{amount}}" data-key="amount" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}"/><textarea placeholder="更正原因，2至200字" maxlength="200" value="{{reason}}" data-key="reason" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy}}">确认更正</button></view><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新读取钱包</button><view wx:if="{{busy}}">正在处理…</view></view>
</block>
